<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko" data-ekodi-ministry-private="finance">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow,noarchive">
  <title>회원 재정공개 · 에코디선교회</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://ekodi.kr/ekodimission/my/finance">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/ekodimission/assets/shell.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/ekodimission/assets/finance.css">
  <script src="/ekodimission/assets/shell.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/ekodimission/assets/finance.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="mission-site-header">
    <a class="mission-brand" href="/ekodimission/"><span class="mission-brand-mark">E</span><span><strong>에코디선교회</strong><small>EKODI MISSION</small></span></a>
    <nav aria-label="주요 메뉴" data-mission-nav></nav>
  </header>
  <main class="ministry-finance">
    <a class="back" href="/ekodimission/">선교회 홈페이지</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">MEMBER FINANCIAL TRANSPARENCY</p>
    <h1>공동체 재정공개</h1>
    <p>승인된 선교회 회원에게 항목별로 공개가 허용된 수입·지출 요약만 보여드립니다. 다른 후원자의 개인 내역과 계좌·증빙 원문은 제공하지 않습니다.</p>
    <p id="financeState" class="status" role="status">로그인 상태를 확인하고 있습니다.</p>
    <a id="financeLogin" class="button" hidden href="#">Google 계정으로 로그인</a>
    <section id="financeApp" hidden>
      <form id="financeFilters" class="filters">
        <label>조회연도 <select id="financeYear"></select></label>
        <fieldset><legend>공개 항목 선택</legend>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="section" value="income" checked> 수입</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="section" value="expense" checked> 지출</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="section" value="balance" checked> 잔액</label>
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="section" value="budget"> 예산·집행</label>
        </fieldset>
        <button type="submit">승인 자료 조회</button>
      </form>
      <p id="financePeriod" class="period"></p>
      <div id="financeRows" class="finance-rows" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </section>
    <p class="privacy">구글 로그인만으로 선교회 회원 자격이 자동 부여되지는 않습니다. 관리자가 등록한 회원 관계가 확인되어야 조회할 수 있습니다.</p>
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer"><div><strong>에코디선교회</strong><p>투명한 살림, 존중받는 나눔</p></div></footer>
</body>
</html>